Math for Trades, Volume 1 — Flinn and Overgaard (@ql-source-trades-1: 0, is #book, #part-of @ql-sources) { r_6Y3242WPAXXCT6D8WY7Q312DQ0
Chad Flinn and Mark Overgaard. Math for Trades: Volume 1. BCcampus, 2020. English. Ebook ISBN 978-1-77420-061-2.

[Publisher's complete book and downloads](https://opentextbc.ca/mathfortrades1/). CC BY 4.0, except separately credited components; preserve the authors, title, publisher, source, and component credits when reusing. The cover and other third-party images have their own notices.

Read the whole volume at the beginning: Whole Numbers, Fractions, Decimals, Percentages, and the practice test. Attempt the exercises before consulting Appendix B. Offline quiz copies are in Appendix C. The book's trade situations make arithmetic concrete; the companion Records add signs, explicit reference quantities, and process examples used across industries.

The publisher offers EPUB, digital and print PDF, and other formats. Follow its download choices for a personal retained copy. This repository stores the reading guidance and reference, not the book. The edition and licence were checked against the publisher on 28 October 2026.

**Return:** [Quantitative literacy sources — books, standards, and articles](../Sources.lingua#r_7MMXWNA1B4YGA271KMHPPJEK9Q).
